"""Walk-through of lesson 20, REST, RPC & GraphQL.

Example numbers (mine): an order screen needs an order, its 3 items and the seller. Each round trip costs 100 ms on a phone, plus 10 ms on the server.
REST: 3 calls one after another (the seller call needs an id from the order): 3 x 110 = 330 ms.
  order 40 fields (6 used), items 30 fields (12 used), seller 30 fields (2 used): 100 fields, 20 used, 80 unused; about 6 + 3 + 4 = 13 KB.
GraphQL: 1 call, 110 ms, only the 20 fields (about 2 KB), 0 unused.
A nested query with 20 objects per level and 5 levels reaches 20^5 = 3,200,000 objects.
A list of 2 million items at about 200 bytes each is about 400 MB in one response.
"""
